<title>POLAND: Polish Poligrafia to start bourse trade Feb 6.</title>
<headline>Polish Poligrafia to start bourse trade Feb 6.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish printing house Poligrafia SA will enter the parallel market of the Warsaw bourse on February 6, the president of the bourse said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Introducing Poligrafia SA's shares on the parallel market (of the bourse will take place) on February 6,&quot; Wieslaw Rozlucki said after the bourse's session.</p>
<p>In November public offering Poligrafia sold 1.4 million shares priced at 7.5 zlotys per share.</p>
<p>The issue increased the number of shares in the firm to 3.6 million. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
